        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Igor Sikorsky\n- Products: Sikorsky S-1, Sikorsky S-2\n- Topics: fixed-wing aircraft, aviation pioneer\n\nFacts:\n- Igor Ivanovich Sikorsky was a Russian-American aviation pioneer in both helicopters and fixed-wing aircraft.\n- The Sikorsky S-1 was the first fixed-wing aircraft designed by Igor Sikorsky.\n- Further attempts with the Sikorsky S-1 were less successful, and Igor Sikorsky disassembled it while saving the main wing section to build the Sikorsky S-2.\n- The Sikorsky S-2, the second aircraft designed and built by Igor Sikorsky, was his first successful aircraft.",
